# ThreadSanitizer suppressions.
#
# Dependencies come from vcpkg and are built without instrumentation, so TSan
# cannot see synchronisation inside them and may report races it cannot prove
# safe. Suppress only third-party frames here.
#
# NEVER suppress a frame in src/ or include/ -- in a lock-free ring buffer a
# TSan report is far more likely to be a real bug than a false positive.
# Add an entry only with a comment saying why it is safe.

# called_from_lib:libcrypto.so
